<<<
critique is in less common use than it was, &, with review, criticism, & notice, ready at need, there is some hope of its dying out.
===
**critique** is in less common use than it was, &, with *review*, *criticism*, & *notice*, ready at need, there is some hope of its dying out.
>>>

<<<
crochet, croquet, make -eting, -eted, pronounced kro’shiing, kro’kiing, kr6’shid, kro’kid.
